# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit .env / .env.local.
#
# Only the public, RLS-protected browser client key belongs here.
# NEVER put service_role, the database password, or any admin/server
# secret in a VITE_-prefixed variable — Vite inlines VITE_* variables
# into the client bundle at build time, so anything here ships to the
# browser. See src/lib/env.ts and docs/REACT_MIGRATION_PLAN.md.

